message.content:
To retrieve the CNAME records for **sample.com** you can query VirusTotal’s “Domain Records” endpoint:

```
GET https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/domains/sample.com/records?record_type=CNAME
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY
Accept: application/json
```

Replace `YOUR_API_KEY` with your actual key (`secret123`).  
The response will look something like this (truncated):

```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "CNAME_1",
      "attributes": { ... }
    },
    {
      "id": "CNAME_2",
      "attributes": { ... }
    }
  ]
}
```

Return only the `"id"` values from each object in the `"data"` array.
